\* All TLC check configs for AntflyReplayDeleteSupersession.tla.

==== positive tier=fast
SPECIFICATION FairSpec

CONSTANT
    BuggyRetryDeleted = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    Safety

PROPERTIES
    DurableDeleteEventuallyConverges

==== Bad
\* Treating a durably tombstoned source as an ordinary transient miss leaves
\* the stale upsert permanently ahead of the later delete.
SPECIFICATION FairSpec

CONSTANT
    BuggyRetryDeleted = TRUE

PROPERTIES
    DurableDeleteEventuallyConverges
